WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.586
Danny, why are you
crawling around in the dark?

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:03.629
Lisa: Were you actually asleep?

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:04.755
Danny: Of course not.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:05.964
I was trying
to save on lightbulbs.

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:08.926
Lisa: Haven't slept
for about two months.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.010
Chronic insomnia.

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:13.889
Danny: Hypnotism, acupuncture,
none of it works.

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:16.391
- You still up?
- How was your day?

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:21.104
Ooh! I saw this ad for
some new pills called Snoozers.

00:00:21.188 --> 00:00:22.356
No, they don't knock you out.

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:24.107
They just make everything
taste like cabbage…

00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:25.859
- apart from cabbage.
- (Lisa laughs)

00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:28.028
Lisa: Aw, it's a little dog.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.239
Little? I could put a saddle
on it and ride it into town.

00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:30.864
(Laughs)

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.116
Sorry, it's my bedtime.
Mwah!

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.202
- Hey!
- There you are.

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.328
Danny: You remember that dating
app that you signed me up for?

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.788
- I got a match.
- That's great!

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.873
Who kept calling you all night?

00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:41.166
- Lisa?
- We're just mates.

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:42.793
Amy: Not from where
I'm standing.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.004
Veggie: When I'm sleeping,
there's this

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:48.340
whole world of Lisa's
that I know nothing about.

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.466
- Hello.
- I'm not stealing.

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:50.342
- What?
- What?

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:53.011
- Oh, my God!
- What?

00:00:53.095 --> 00:00:54.596
There's a big bunch of cows.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:55.764
Cows?

00:00:55.848 --> 00:00:57.558
- Do cows attack?
- Let me check.

00:00:59.518 --> 00:01:00.352
Yeah, yeah, they do attack.

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:01.854
- And they do… and they kill.
- What?

00:01:02.855 --> 00:01:07.901
♪

00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:08.902
Veggie: I don't think
you know what it's like

00:01:08.986 --> 00:01:11.905
for your partner to come alive
as soon as you go to bed.

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:15.576
Lisa: I don't know
what I want to do.

00:01:15.659 --> 00:01:16.827
Danny: We're all
trying our best.

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:19.746
All it takes is that one person
to really see you.

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:24.501
- Tonight is the big night.
- First date.

00:01:24.585 --> 00:01:27.462
I've come up with a few ideas
to help her feel more at ease.

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:29.381
Why don't you just put
a padlock on your fly?

00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:30.966
I think that'll really
put her at ease.

00:01:31.592 --> 00:01:32.426
'Cause it…

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:33.510
- what do you mean, really?
- No!

